<div class="mandarin-hanzi">昨天</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">zuótiān</div>

''Meaning:'' yesterday  
''Part of speech:'' noun; time word

!! In context
昨天我在家休息。 — Zuótiān wǒ zài jiā xiūxi. — Yesterday I rested at home.

!! Usage note
A time expression ('yesterday'). Mandarin verbs do not automatically mark past tense; time reference can come from words such as 昨天.
